cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ilang-Benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "iLang Benchmark: a reproducible test suite for iLang prompts"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark suite that runs iLang prompts and natural-language baselines
  over the same 30 tasks in six categories: text summarisation, table
  transformation, code generation, data extraction, multi-turn workflows and
  complex pipelines. It ships the test cases, the runner scripts, the
  collected results and a report template, and runs against any
  OpenAI-compatible endpoint or offline in mock mode. A separate sub-benchmark
  tests whether the v5.0 judgment mapping from the 11-dimension vector to a
  decision mode is learnable from examples.
type: software
